\ grade: takes a score 0..100 on the stack, prints its letter grade
: grade
  dup 90 >= if 65 emit else    \ A
  dup 80 >= if 66 emit else    \ B
  dup 70 >= if 67 emit else    \ C
  dup 60 >= if 68 emit else    \ D
  70 emit then then then then  \ F
  cr
;

\ examples:
95 grade
82 grade
73 grade
64 grade
45 grade
